name: Retain a rejected scope response and correct it locally without another request or acceptance
size: 120x36
# One labeled intercepted response. No real inference or target source execution.
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: NODE_OPTIONS KUZUSHI_MODEL KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE KUZUSHI_AGENT_MCPS ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY NO_COLOR
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/scope_recovery.py @TMP_TARGET @ART seed @TMP_HOME
require-wrapper-flow:
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | ready
submit: campaign owned-scope-recovery
require-live-snap: 25 1 planned | fixed-proposal
nav-mode:
keys: a
require-live-snap: 25 SUGGEST SCAN SCOPES | retained-output-choice
expect: retain at most 16 KiB
ask: Before execution, does the fixed proposal disclose local rejected-text retention, its sensitive-data boundary and the single shared request allowance?
keys: Escape
require-live-snap: 25 CAMPAIGN owned-scope-recovery | back-from-proposal
keys: L
require-live-snap: 25 dispatcher pid | one-proposal-started
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/scope_recovery.py @TMP_TARGET @ART failed
keys: r
require-live-snap: 25 1 failed | recorded-failure
keys: L
require-live-snap: 25 new approved plan | consumed-attempt-refused
keys: a
require-live-snap: 25 contracts | failed-scope-form
expect: d output
expect-not: LABELED_OFFLINE_SCOPE_CANDIDATE
keys: d
require-live-snap: 25 REJECTED SCOPE OUTPUT | explicit-private-inspection
expect: LABELED_OFFLINE_SCOPE_CANDIDATE
expect: UNACCEPTED MODEL OUTPUT
ask: Is the retained candidate available only through explicit local inspection, labeled unaccepted, with the original failure and spending preserved?
keys: e C-Home
require-live-snap: 25 CORRECT SCOPE JSON | correction-editor
keys: Enter C-s
require-live-snap: 30 Correction not saved | invalid-correction-kept
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/scope_recovery.py @TMP_TARGET @ART invalid
ask: Does invalid scope JSON fail local membership validation while keeping the edited text, original one-request failure and unaccepted scope unchanged?
resize: 160x48
live-snap: editor-160x48
resize: 96x89
live-snap: editor-96x89
resize: 80x24
live-snap: editor-80x24
resize: 60x20
live-snap: editor-60x20
resize: 40x12
live-snap: editor-40x12
expect: Ctrl+S save
expect: Esc kept
keys: NPage
live-snap: editor-page-40x12
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/scope_recovery.py @TMP_TARGET @ART paged
ask: Across six sizes, do the correction editor, cursor and visible save/read/back controls remain usable without exposing hidden workflow shortcuts?
resize: 120x36
keys: C-End C-u
paste-file: @ART/labeled-corrected-scope.json
live-snap: corrected-json-draft
keys: Escape
require-live-snap: 20 REJECTED SCOPE OUTPUT | editor-return-kept
keys: Escape
require-live-snap: 20 SUGGEST SCAN SCOPES | correction-form-return
keys: n
require-live-snap: 20 Your JSON draft is kept | new-proposal-preserves-draft
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/scope_recovery.py @TMP_TARGET @ART kept
keys: d e
require-live-snap: 20 CORRECT SCOPE JSON | restored-correction-editor
keys: C-s
require-live-snap: 30 Review corrected scope draft | corrected-unaccepted-receipt
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/scope_recovery.py @TMP_TARGET @ART corrected
expect: Original job remains failed
ask: Does saving produce a separate manually corrected revision with recomputed coverage, while the producer remains failed and no request, acceptance or scan is added?
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 DRAFT SCOPES | corrected-scope-tree
expect: Manually corrected
expect: Original proposal job remains failed
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 NO_COLOR=1
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | restarted
submit: campaign owned-scope-recovery
require-live-snap: 25 1 failed | recovered-failed-producer
nav-mode:
keys: a
require-live-snap: 25 Review corrected scope draft | recovered-correction-link
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 DRAFT SCOPES | recovered-unaccepted-scopes
expect: Manually corrected
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/scope_recovery.py @TMP_TARGET @ART restarted
ask: Does no-color restart recover the manually corrected scope tree through the failed campaign without rewriting its history, spending again or accepting boundaries?
keys: a
require-live-snap: 20 Accept exact boundaries | explicit-corrected-boundary-approval
keys: Enter End Enter
require-live-snap: 30 ACCEPTED SCOPES | explicitly-accepted-correction
keys: p
require-live-snap: 25 PLAN A STUDY | corrected-scope-planning
expect: 1 committed / 1 total
keys: Down Down Down Down Down
require-live-snap: 20 owned-scope-recovery-accounting | inherited-investigation-detail
expect: 1 committed / 1 total
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/scope_recovery.py @TMP_TARGET @ART planning
ask: After explicit boundary acceptance, does scan planning retain the original investigation and its spent call, with no scan approval, new job, request or allowance reset?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
